w not only derails Gray's plans but also leads to a mysterious murder whose solution lies at the heart of this captivating story.\"--BOOK JACKET."}, "latest_revision": 17, "revision": 17, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2008-04-01T03:28:50.625462"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-11-13T18:12:28.766544"}}